        "kind": "code",
        "source": "def oracle_min_cost(supply, demand, cost):\n    best = [float(\"inf\")]\n    remaining = list(demand)\n\n    def place(i, j, left, acc):\n        if acc >= best[0]:\n            return\n        if i == len(supply):\n            if all(value == 0 for value in remaining):\n                best[0] = acc\n            return\n        if j == len(demand):\n            if left == 0:\n                nxt = supply[i + 1] if i + 1 < len(supply) else 0\n                place(i + 1, 0, nxt, acc)\n            return\n        for qty in range(min(left, remaining[j]) + 1):\n            remaining[j] -= qty\n            place(i, j + 1, left - qty, acc + qty * cost[i][j])\n            remaining[j] += qty\n\n    place(0, 0, supply[0], 0)\n    if best[0] == float(\"inf\"):\n        raise RuntimeError(\"no feasible shipment\")\n    return best[0]\n\noracle = oracle_min_cost(supply, demand, cost)\nprint(\"独立枚举最小运费:\", oracle)\nassert abs(result[\"objective\"] - oracle) < 1e-6\nfor i in range(len(supply)):\n    assert sum(result[\"shipments\"][i]) == supply[i]\nfor j in range(len(demand)):\n    assert sum(result[\"shipments\"][i][j] for i in range(len(supply))) == demand[j]\nprint(\"通过：求解器目标与独立枚举一致，供需约束满足\")"
