    "id": "08_IE_Cutting_Stock_PySCIPOpt",
    "file": "08_IE_Cutting_Stock_PySCIPOpt.ipynb",
    "title": "IE-OPT-08 · 铝材下料",
    "summary": "场景：北麓门窗厂把长度 16 分米的标准铝材锯成三种窗料。本周订单是立挺 6 分米 6 根、横档 5 分米 5 根、压条 4 分米 7 根。一根母材只能按一种裁法切开，问至少要用多少根母材。",
    "cells": [
      {
        "kind": "markdown",
        "source": "# IE-OPT-08 · 铝材下料\n\n**场景**：北麓门窗厂把长度 16 分米的标准铝材锯成三种窗料。本周订单是立挺 6 分米 6 根、横档 5 分米 5 根、压条 4 分米 7 根。一根母材只能按一种裁法切开，问至少要用多少根母材。\n\n裁法先在小宽度上全部列出来，再决定每种裁法用几次。工业规模的下料会用列生成，因为裁法数量会随规格变多；这个例子宽度只有 16，枚举裁法是可行的。数据为合成教学数据。\n\n练习用，不计正式成绩。"
      },
      {
        "kind": "markdown",
        "source": "## 1. 模型要点\n\n- 先列出「不能再塞进任何一种窗料」的裁法。对覆盖模型来说，这样做不改变最少母材数：没裁满的方案总能再放一根料，母材根数不会增加。\n- $y_p$ 是非负整数，表示裁法 $p$ 使用的母材根数。\n- 最小化 $\\sum_p y_p$。\n- 对每种窗料，各裁法产出的根数之和不少于订单。\n\n允许某种料多切出来。模型不管锯缝、余料回收价和交货顺序。"
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "source": "from pyscipopt import Model, quicksum\n\nWIDTH = 16\npiece_names = [\"立挺\", \"横档\", \"压条\"]\nlengths = [6, 5, 4]\ndemands = [6, 5, 7]\nassert all(0 < length <= WIDTH for length in lengths)\n\ndef maximal_patterns(width, lengths):\n    found = []\n\n    def rec(index, left, counts):\n        if index == len(lengths):\n            if width - left > 0 and left < min(lengths):\n                found.append(tuple(counts))\n            return\n        room = left // lengths[index]\n        for count in range(room + 1):\n            rec(index + 1, left - count * lengths[index], counts + (count,))\n\n    rec(0, width, ())\n    return found\n\npatterns = maximal_patterns(WIDTH, lengths)\nprint(\"可用裁法数:\", len(patterns))\nfor pattern in patterns:\n    used = sum(length * count for length, count in zip(lengths, pattern))\n    print(dict(zip(piece_names, pattern)), \"用去\", used, \"分米\")"
      },
      {
        "kind": "markdown",
        "source": "## 2. 用母材根数做目标"
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "source": "def solve_cutting_stock(patterns, demands):\n    model = Model(\"IE-OPT-08 cutting stock\")\n    model.hideOutput(True)\n    y = {p: model.addVar(vtype=\"I\", lb=0, name=f\"rolls_{p}\") for p in range(len(patterns))}\n    for i, need in enumerate(demands):\n        model.addCons(quicksum(patterns[p][i] * y[p] for p in y) >= need)\n    model.setObjective(quicksum(y[p] for p in y), \"minimize\")\n    model.optimize()\n    status = str(model.getStatus())\n    if status != \"optimal\":\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"Solver status is {status}; optimality not certified\")\n    used = {p: int(round(model.getVal(y[p]))) for p in y if model.getVal(y[p]) > 0.5}\n    return {\"objective\": float(model.getObjVal()), \"used\": used}\n\nresult = solve_cutting_stock(patterns, demands)\nprint(\"最少母材:\", result[\"objective\"])\nfor index, times in sorted(result[\"used\"].items()):\n    print(f\"裁法 {patterns[index]} 使用 {times} 根\")"
      },
      {
        "kind": "markdown",
        "source": "## 3. 按剩余订单做动态规划\n\n状态是三种窗料还缺多少。每用一根母材就选一种裁法，把订单减去这次实际切出的数量。状态数是各需求加一的乘积，和 SCIP 的分支过程无关。"
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "source": "def oracle_min_rolls(demands, patterns):\n    cache = {}\n\n    def dp(state):\n        if state in cache:\n            return cache[state]\n        if all(value == 0 for value in state):\n            cache[state] = 0\n            return 0\n        best = 10**6\n        for pattern in patterns:\n            nxt = []\n            useful = False\n            for need, cut in zip(state, pattern):\n                take = min(need, cut)\n                useful = useful or take > 0\n                nxt.append(need - take)\n            if useful:\n                best = min(best, 1 + dp(tuple(nxt)))\n        cache[state] = best\n        return best\n\n    answer = dp(tuple(demands))\n    if answer >= 10**6:\n        raise RuntimeError(\"patterns cannot cover the order\")\n    return answer\n\noracle = oracle_min_rolls(demands, patterns)\nprint(\"独立动态规划最少母材:\", oracle)\nassert abs(result[\"objective\"] - oracle) < 1e-6\nproduced = [0, 0, 0]\nfor index, times in result[\"used\"].items():\n    for i in range(3):\n        produced[i] += patterns[index][i] * times\nassert all(got >= need for got, need in zip(produced, demands))\nprint(\"通过：求解器目标与动态规划一致，订单被覆盖\")"
      },
      {
        "kind": "markdown",
        "source": "## 4. 可以接着改什么\n\n1. 把母材改成 15 分米，看最少根数和余料怎么变。\n2. 给余料一个回收收入，目标改成「母材成本减去回收」，注意回收不能高于材料本身。\n3. 规格很多时不要再手写全部裁法。那时才需要列生成；本例故意留在可以穷举的规模。"
      }
    ]
